      "message": {
        "title": "ORCL Stock Slides To Early August Levels – $165B New Mexico Project In Focus After Company Reportedly Cites ‘Force Majeure’",
        "body": "According to a Bloomberg report, Oracle is seeking to defer certain payments if the New Mexico AI data center misses its planned 2028 launch.",
